---
---

<section class="section contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-panel" data-reveal>
      <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <span class="contact-emoji" aria-hidden="true">👋</span>
      <h2>Ada pertanyaan atau masukan?</h2>
      <p>Saya senang mendengarnya — baik dari sesama guru, murid, atau siapa pun yang mampir.</p>
      <a href="/kontak" class="btn btn-primary" data-magnetic>Hubungi Saya</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-panel {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, var(--ink) 0%, #2a3a7a 55%, var(--accent-2) 130%);
    color: #f4f7ff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .contact-panel h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-emoji {
    font-size: 2rem;
    animation: wave 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes wave {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    15% { transform: rotate(14deg); }
    30% { transform: rotate(-8deg); }
    45% { transform: rotate(14deg); }
    60% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  }

  .contact-panel p {
    color: rgba(244, 247, 255, 0.75);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-panel .btn-primary {
    /* Sengaja pakai warna tetap (bukan var(--ink)/var(--accent-ink)) — latar
       panel ini juga tetap gradien navy-ungu di kedua mode, jadi tombolnya
       ikut dikunci putih-solid + teks navy pekat supaya kontras selalu
       terjaga, tidak ikut memudar saat HP mode gelap. */
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #12172c;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .contact-panel .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #f4f7ff;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .contact-emoji {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
